1
00:00:00,660 --> 00:00:02,900
(Được chép bởi TurboScribe. Nâng cấp lên Không giới hạn để gỡ bỏ thông báo này.) She takes out her coloring book.

2
00:00:03,740 --> 00:00:05,900
She gets her crayons.

3
00:00:07,119 --> 00:00:09,100
She opens the book.

4
00:00:10,340 --> 00:00:13,700
There is a drawing of a bunny dancing.

5
00:00:14,900 --> 00:00:18,880
She colors the bunny with a brown crayon.

6
00:00:19,860 --> 00:00:23,920
She colors the sky with a blue crayon.

7
00:00:24,720 --> 00:00:29,100
She colors the flower with a red crayon.

8
00:00:29,880 --> 00:00:32,620
She rips the page out.

9
00:00:33,400 --> 00:00:35,920
She sticks it to the wall.
